  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene"><head>ΑΛΚΜΗΝΗ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:88">
            <note type="source">1. Ad Aristophanis in Ranis vs. 93. verba “χελιδόνων μουσεῖα, λωβηταὶ τέχνης" adnotat schol.:</note>
            <note type="commentary">παρὰ τὰ ἐν Ἀλκμήνῃ Εὐριπίδου</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">πολὺς δ᾽ ἀνεῖρπε κισσὸς, εὐφυὴς κλάδος,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">χελιδόνων μουσεῖον -</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">ἀντὶ τοῦ βάρβαρα καὶ ἀσύνετα. κ. τ. λ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:89">
            <note type="source">2. Ad Aristoph. ibid. vs. 540. dicentem: “ μετακυλινδεῖν αὑτὸν ἀεὶ πρὸς τὸν εὐ πράττοντα τοίχον μᾶλλον κ. τ. λ. adscribit schol.:</note>
            <note type="commentary">Ὅμοιον τῷ ἐν Ἀλκμήνῃ Εὐριπίδου</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">οὐ γάρ ποτ' εἴων Σθένελον ἐς τὸν εὐτυχῆ</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">χωροῦντα τοῖχον τῆς δίκης ἀποστερεῖν.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">παροιμία δέ ἐστι, πρὸς τὸν εὖ πράττοντα τοῖχον ῥέπειν, ἐπὶ τῶν περὶ τὸ λυσιτελοῦν αὑτοῖς ἀεὶ στρεφομένων. εἴρηται δὲ ἐκ μεταφορᾶς τῶν ἐπιβατῶν τῆς νεὼς, ὅταν θατέρου μέρους αὐτοῖς κατακλυζομένου, πρὸς τὸ ἕτερον οὗτοι μεθίστανται. Cf. Pors. ad Orest. 885.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene">
            <note type="source">3. Stobæus VIII, 12.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὁ φόβος, ὅταν τις σώματος μέλλῃ πέρι</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">λέγειν καταστὰς εἰς ἀγῶν᾽ ἐναντίον,</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">τό τε στόμ᾽ εἰς ἔκπληξιν ἀνθρώπων ἄγει,</l>
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">τὸν νοῦν τ᾿ ἀπείργει μὰ λέγειν ὁ βούλεται.</l>
              <l n="5" xml:lang="grc">τῷ μὲν γὰρ ἔνι κίνδυνος, ὁ δ᾽ ἀθῶος μένει·</l>
              <l n="6" xml:lang="grc">ὅμως δ᾽ ἀγῶνα τόνδε δεῖ μ᾽ ὑπερδραμεῖν·</l>
              <l n="7" xml:lang="grc">ψυχην γὰρ ἆθλα τιθεμένην ἐμὴν ὁρῶ.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:91">
            <note type="source">4. Stobæus XLIII, 22.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀτρέκεια δ᾽ ἄριστον ἀνδρὸς ἐν πόλει δικαιου πέλει</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-5" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:92">
            <note type="source">5. Stobæus XLV, 9.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἴστω δ᾽ ἄφρων ὢν, ὅστις ἄνθρωπος γεγὼς</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">δῆμον κολούει, χρήμασιν γαυρούμενος.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="6" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-6" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:99">
            <note type="source">6. Stobæus XLV, 12.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Τὸν εὐτυχοῦντα χρὴ σοφὸν πεφυκέναι.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">Simile est fgm. X.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="7" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-7" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:93">
            <note type="source">7. Stobæus LXII, 24.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀεὶ δ᾽ ἀρέσκειν τοῖς κρατοῦσι· ταῦτα γὰρ</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">δούλοις ἄριστα· κἀφ᾽ ὅτῳ τεταγμένος</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">εἴη τις, ἁνδάνοντα δεσπόταις ποιεῖν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="8" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-8" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:103">
            <note type="source">8. Stobæus LXXXIII, 6.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Δεινόν τι τέκνων φίλτρον ἔθηκεν</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">θεὸς ἀνθρώποις.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">a. 1609.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="9" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-9" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:95">
            <note type="source">9. Stobæus XCII, 1. Ant. Melissa et Maximus Monach. in edit. Stobæi Serm. CXL, p. 218, 24.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀλλ᾽ οὐδὲν ηὑγένεια πρὸς τὰ χρήματα·</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">τὸν γὰρ κάκιστον πλοῦτος εἰς πρώτους ἄγει.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="10" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-10" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:96">
            <note type="source">10. Stobæus XCIII, 15.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Σκαιόν τι χρῆμα πλοῦτος ἥ τ᾽ ἀπειρία.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="11" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-11" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:101">
            <note type="source">11. Stobæus XCVIII, 22.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀλλ᾽ ἡμέρα τοι πολλὰ καὶ μέλαινα νὺξ</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">τίκτει βροτοῖς.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="12" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-12" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:97">
            <note type="source">12. Stobæus XCIX, 16.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀλλ᾽ οὐ γὰρ ὀρθῶς ταῦτα, γενναίως δ᾽ ἴσως</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ἔπραξας· αἰνεῖσθαι θὲ δυστυχῶν ἐγὼ</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">μισῶ· λόγος γὰρ τοῦργον οὐ νικᾷ ποτέ.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="13" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-13" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:98">
            <note type="source">13. Stobæus CVIII, 18.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀλλ᾽ εὐ φέρειν χρὴ συμφορὰς τὸν εὐγενῆ.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="14" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-14" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:100">
            <note type="source">14. Stobæus CXI, 7.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Θάρσει· τάχ᾽ ἂν γένοιτο· πολλά τοι θεὸς</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">κἀκ τῶν ἀέλπτων εὔπορ᾽ ἀνθρώποις τελεῖ.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="15" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-15" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:102">
            <note type="source">15. Stobæus CXIV, 3.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Σοφώτεροι γὰρ συμφορὰς τὰς τῶν πέλας</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">πάντες διαιρεῖν, ἢ τύχας τὰς οἴκοθεν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="16" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-16" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:90">
            <note type="source">16. Pollux Χ, 117.</note>
            <note type="commentary">Πανὸς καὶ φανὸς ἡ λαμπὰς, ὡς ὅταν φῇ ἐν Ἀλκμήνῃ Εὐριπίδης</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Πόθεν δὲ πεύκης πανὸν ἐξεῦρες λαβεῖν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="17" xml:id="fragment-alkmene-dindorf1893_grc1-17" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_alkmene" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.alkmene.nauck1889grc1:104">
            <note type="source">17. Hesych. Ἀμολγὸν νύκτα Εὐριπίδης Ἀλκμήνῃ ζοφερὰν καὶ σκοτεινήν. cf. Æsch. ap. Athen. ΧΙ, p. 469 F. Buttm. Lexilog. II, p. 43, 19.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
